      "id": "claim_6aa30656a4c94ab4928d40011e47bd4e",
      "statement": "The CLI obtains Keycloak ID tokens via a browser-based authorization-code PKCE flow (acquireBrowserToken) or a separate device-authorization flow (acquireDeviceToken), caches the token with restrictive 0600 file permissions, and treats a token as unusable if it is within 30 seconds of expiry either on cache read or immediately after acquisition.",
