    {
      "id": "claim_5b9359a9ceed4258bc9292683b25daca",
      "statement": "Role selection moved to commandPreRun in internal/cmd/cli.go: investigation create and session create authenticate with the invoker role, while every other operational command selects the shared SRE role directly as its initial authentication role. session create (runStartSession) then assumes the shared SRE role for ECS task access via a second assumeRoleWithRetryOptions call after invoking the Lambda, whereas investigation create (runCreateInvestigation) makes a single invoker-only Lambda call (skip_task) and never performs a second role assumption because it creates no ECS task.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://internal/cmd/cli.go#L56-L136",
