      "id": "claim_459d8e0498934d5b97fa712dbff94ac2",
      "statement": "deploy/account/github-oidc.tf manages the GitHub Actions OIDC provider in three mutually exclusive modes (create, reference-only via data lookup, or adopt via a declarative import block) selected by create_github_actions_oidc_provider and adopt_existing_resources, pins the client audience to the fixed local sts.amazonaws.com rather than exposing it as a variable, and omits a thumbprint because the AWS provider computes it.",
