      "id": "claim_fefa8cd1c83a485289b17448eddcc47d",
      "statement": "The shared-iam module creates one dedicated IAM role per configured GitHub content-publisher source (never a single shared publisher role), trusting GitHub Actions OIDC via StringEquals on a fixed repo:<repository>:ref:refs/heads/<branch> subject and the pinned audience; validation on content_publisher_sources rejects wildcards, colons, and full refs so no configured value can widen the trust subject to a pull request, merge ref, or GitHub Actions environment.",
